            "isLive": false,
            "metadata": "",
            "deleted": false,
            "type": "Body",
            "topMarginOverride": 20,
            "bottomMarginOverride": -1,
            "leftMarginOverride": -1,
            "rightMarginOverride": -1,
            "title": [
                "",
                "",
                "",
                "",
                "",
                ""
            ],
            "body": [
                "The Orgoth have returned. Led by a dire prophecy back to the lands they once ruled, they have made war on the nations of the Iron Kingdoms with more than simple conquest in mind. They seek nothing less than the destruction of the gods themselves. After obtaining an immensely powerful infernal artifact, the Orgoth are closer to their goal, but they have a new target—the dragon Blighterghast. The great wyrm’s death would secure an alliance with the dread empire of Cryx, and the combined might of the Orgoth and the Dragonfather Toruk would drown the Iron Kingdoms in blood.\nIn order to stem the tide of horror and destruction, the nations of the Iron Kingdoms have banded together in a tenuous alliance and now find themselves in the uniquely bizarre position of Blighterghast’s defenders. The Orgoth have attacked the dragon and begun an abominable ritual to bring about the wyrm’s death. It is clear Blighterghast is doomed, but all is not lost. If the defenders can keep the dragon alive long enough, they may interrupt the ritual and derail the Orgoth’s awful plan.",
                "",
                "",
                "",
                "",
                ""
            ],
            "colorHex": "",
            "textColorHex": "",
            "mediaPath": "",
            "widthPerc": 100,
            "mediaWidth": 0,
            "mediaHeight": 0,
            "caption": [
                "",
                "",
                "",
                "",
                "",
                ""
            ],
            "isSub": false,
            "helpTermSorting": [],
            "helpTermIds": []
        },
        {
