            ],
            "body": [
                "At the Dragonfall Legendary Event, tables are arranged in a large cross configuration with the massive dragon Blighterghast sitting in the middle of it, ready to rain pain down on everyone. Understandably, not everyone has the space, the terrain, or the massive dragon at home to run such an event. So, we will lay out here a simpler and expandable version, flexible enough for those at home to play.",
                "",
                "",
                "",
                "",
                ""
            ],
            "colorHex": "",
