            "leftMarginOverride": -1,
            "rightMarginOverride": -1,
            "title": [
                "",
                "",
                "",
                "",
                "",
                ""
            ],
            "body": [
                "In Dragonfall, the Invaders are trying to feed soul energy to the Lash of Horva in an attempt to dominate Blighterghast. To accomplish this, the Invaders have surrounded the area with soul pyres, which they must keep lit throughout the battle while protecting the Lash of Horva from being destroyed. Meanwhile, the Defenders are attempting to extinguish the pyres while also trying to destroy the Lash of Horva. All players on the same team take their turns simultaneously – that is, all Defenders players play through the Defender’s turn at the same time, and all Invaders players play through the Invader’s turn at the same time. The Defenders are the first player (P1) and will take the first turn. The Invaders are the second player (P2).",
                "",
                "",
                "",
                "",
                ""
            ],
