            "bottomMarginOverride": -1,
            "leftMarginOverride": -1,
            "rightMarginOverride": -1,
            "title": [
                "",
                "",
                "",
                "",
                "",
                ""
            ],
            "body": [
                "At the end of each team’s turn, check to see which team has secured each objective. If a team has two or more models within 3\" of a Soul Pyre objective and no opposing team’s models are within that 3\" area as well, that team has secured that Soul Pyre.\nIf the Defenders have secured a Soul Pyre, place an Extinguish token on that Soul Pyre. If there are 2 Extinguish tokens on that Soul Pyre, it has been extinguished. Remove it from play.\nIf the Defenders have secured the Lash of Horva, place an Extinguish token on any Soul Pyre in play, then remove d3 soul tokens from the Lash. The Lash of Horva cannot gain soul tokens for one round.\nIf the Invaders have secured a Soul Pyre, remove an Extinguish token from that Soul Pyre, if it has one. Add a soul token to the Lash of Horva.\nIf the Invaders have secured the Lash of Horva, remove an Extinguish token from any Soul Pyre in play. Add a soul token to the Lash of Horva.\nThe Invaders win if the Lash of Horva survives through the end of the 7th round or if the Lash of Horva ever has 5 + (the total number of players) soul tokens on it.",
                "",
                "",
                "",
                "",
                ""
            ],
            "colorHex": "",
            "textColorHex": "",
