                "",
                "",
                ""
            ],
            "body": [
                "The Defenders win if they destroy the Lash of Horva.\nFor full rules on the Lash of Horval refer to the Objectives section.\nNOTE: Unlike most games of WARMACHINE, losing a Leader model in this narrative scenario does not mean a player is out of the game! Players who no longer have a Leader model in play may still activate their remaining models as normal, though they still suffer the penalties of losing a Leader. (Any warjacks the Leader controlled go inert; the Leader’s warbeasts go wild; the Leader’s Monstrosities go autonomous; the Leader’s spells and effects expire, etc.)",
                "",
                "",
                "",
                "",
                ""
            ],
