        {
            "guidStr": "736c8a83-e45c-46da-9aa3-f216ccfc33fa",
            "name": [
                "Name",
                "",
                "",
                "",
                ""
            ],
            "isLive": false,
            "metadata": "",
            "deleted": false,
            "type": "Body",
            "topMarginOverride": -1,
            "bottomMarginOverride": -1,
            "leftMarginOverride": -1,
            "rightMarginOverride": -1,
            "title": [
                "",
                "",
                "",
                "",
                "",
                ""
            ],
            "body": [
                "Blighterghast produces 1 random effect at the end of each team’s turn. If you are playing with four or more players, Blighterghast instead produces 2 random effects at the end of each team’s turn. Reroll one of the effects if the 2 random effects are the same.\n[1] Dragon’s Breath —Randomly select a corner of the table and draw a line drawn from that corner to the center of the Lash of Horva. Models touched by that line suffer a POW 20 fire damage roll and the fire continuous effect. This damage is not considered to be from an attack.\n[2-3] Fire Craters — Teams take turns each placing d3 3\" burning earth templates. These templates must be placed in contact with a Soul Pyre, a terrain feature in contact with the Lash of Horva, or another burning earth template. These templates cannot be placed in contact with a model or another terrain feature. These templates remain in play for the rest of the game.\n[4] Earthquakes — All Cohort models within 3\" of a hill terrain feature are knocked down and suffer a POW 15 damage roll. This damage is not considered to be from an attack.",
                "",
                "",
                "",
                "",
                ""
            ],
            "colorHex": "",
            "textColorHex": "",
            "mediaPath": "",
            "widthPerc": 100,
            "mediaWidth": 0,
            "mediaHeight": 0,
            "caption": [
                "",
                "",
                "",
                "",
                "",
                ""
            ],
            "isSub": false,
