                "",
                "",
                "",
                ""
            ],
            "body": [
                "[5] Wing Beats —All warrior models starting their activation within 3\" of an obstruction or advancing within 3\" of an obstruction suffer –3 SPD and –3 RNG to range attacks that activation.\n[6] Poison Clouds — While within 3\" of a volcanic vent terrain feature, models gain Stealth, lose Tough, and cannot have damage removed for one round.",
                "",
                "",
                "",
                "",
                ""
            ],
